meta {
  name: Bestellen
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/web/bon/{{herstelBonnr}}/herstel/bestellen
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.stempel: eq OND.BESTELD
}

docs {
  Transitions DIAGNOSE -> OND.BESTELD. 409 if stempel isn't currently
  DIAGNOSE. Run "Diagnose" first. Note: "Hersteld" further down requires
  stempel IN HERSTELLING, which only happens via the auto-transition in
  Luna.BusinessLogic.BonHerstelBE:CheckAutoTransitionToInHerstelling
  (triggered by Bon/Reservering/Apply.bru bringing every bonlijn's
  gereserv up to te-leveren on a HERSTELLING-type bon) - not directly
  reachable from this folder alone without also creating/reserving a
  bonlijn on {{herstelBonnr}}.
}

